# Shared build context, used by two different build styles:
#   1. CI (ci/Jenkinsfile -> shared `DockerfileBuild`): compiles from source *inside* the image via
#      ./mvnw, so the sources, the Maven wrapper and pom.xml must be in the context. Recipe:
#      src/main/docker/Dockerfile.ci, which the pipeline materialises as ./Dockerfile before building.
#   2. src/main/docker/Dockerfile.{jvm,native,native-micro}: COPY an already-built artifact (build it
#      first with `./mvnw package [-Dnative]`), so target/*.jar and the suffix-less native binary must
#      be in the context. Quarkus's own container-image build picks Dockerfile.jvm by name, which is why
#      that file cannot simply be folded into Dockerfile.ci.
# Strategy: exclude everything, then re-include what each build needs (last matching pattern wins, and
# a file can be re-included even when a bare `*` also matches its parent -- verified against Docker).
*

# Needed by the in-container compile (CI).
!pom.xml
# Every Docker recipe lives here, including Dockerfile.ci: DockerfileConsistencyTest compares the CI
# `final` stage against Dockerfile.jvm, and can only do so where it can read both files -- which is
# also inside the `test` stage's build context. Reading the source path rather than the ./Dockerfile the
# pipeline writes is what keeps that check meaningful in CI; see the test's javadoc.
!src/
!src/**
!mvnw
!mvnw.cmd
!.mvn/
!.mvn/**
# Bundled resources copied into the artifact by pom.xml <resources> (read by the license/changelog cmds).
!LICENSE.txt
!CHANGELOG.md

# Needed by src/main/docker/Dockerfile.* (they COPY an artifact, they do not build one): the über-jar for
# Dockerfile.jvm, the suffix-less binary for the native ones. The CI build needs neither -- it compiles
# from source and takes the jar from its own compile stage.
!target/*.jar
!target/hashbin-cli-*
# Update "hashbin-cli" above if you change <artifactId> in pom.xml.
# ...but never the heavy native-image build intermediate (no Dockerfile reads it; keeps the context lean).
target/hashbin-cli-*-native-image-source-jar/

# Never ship VCS / IDE metadata into an image.
.git/
.idea/
